 "_readme": "The impact library: every /impact/<slug> page. One entry per page. `match` decides which welfare_projects rows (is_draft=false) belong to the page: header/location/text are case-insensitive JS regexes (text = header + short_summary + objective); year matches workshop_date's year; all = every drive. Read by scripts/compute-topic-facts.mjs (counts and drive lists), the app (lib/topics/topicKit.ts), prerender-meta.mjs and generate-sitemap.mjs. The words for each page live in copy/<slug>.json. Add a page: add an entry here and a copy file, then run the build. Neighbourhoods and journey pages are ordinary topics. `stories` are photo essays at /impact/stories/<slug>, built from the named topic's drives (chapters by year); their words are copy/stories/<slug>.json.",
